  <item>
    <title>Vol.42 在作死边缘疯狂试探，恋爱踩雷冠军的自我修养</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686a87fd93fd2d72b8ceb6ac</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686a87fd93fd2d72b8ceb6ac</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Jul 2025 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好呀～</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期又是个吐槽期，这一期我们主要是想要跟大家一起聊聊</span></p><span></span><p><span>“什么？你还不理解你女友为什么生气”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> &nbsp;大家好呀～好久不见啦</span></p><span></span><p><span>问题一 当收到男朋友送的哪些礼物的时候，很崩溃？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">01:11</a> &nbsp;口红礼盒，我有很多张嘴吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">04:09</a> 那富贵的指甲套盒&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 喜欢花，所以送给你永不凋零的永生花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 搜索栏：送女朋友的生日礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 多功能的化妆盒</span></p><span></span><p><span>问题二 哪些行为会让你感到不舒服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 开黄腔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> 随地吐痰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 公众场所抽烟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 在公共场合吵架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 很敷衍的回答你的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a> 想要解决问题，但是当作什么都没发生&amp;生闷气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">25:25</a> 跟异性把控不了距离</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 跟前女友聊天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> 不回复消息，但是在朋友圈点赞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 吵架的时候没吵完就睡了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2115">35:15</a> 男朋友吵架太有逻辑，吵不过hhh</span></p><span></span><p><span>问题三 有哪一些玩笑你觉得不能开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">38:20</a> 把分手，绝交，拉黑挂在嘴边</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2410">40:10</a> 假装记错生日（这是哪个直男想出的地狱玩笑）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a> 浅聊一下恋爱脑和清醒的恋爱脑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2670">44:30</a> 关于父母的玩笑不能开</span></p><span></span><p><span>问题四 哪些行为在你这里绝对不能做</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 出轨&amp;家暴&amp;拉踩爱好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">51:30</a> diss好朋友&amp;地域性的攻击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">52:20</a> 不尊重对方的隐私</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3395">56:35</a> 撒谎或者隐瞒</span></p><span></span><p><span>问题五 他有做过什么让你感动的事情吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3530">58:50</a> 七仔：生病时的照顾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4360">01:12:40</a> 圆仔：提前踩点的约会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4530">01:15:30</a> 月崽：花费的时间精力很难得&amp;手写情书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4745">01:19:05</a> 大家下次再见～&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：没完没聊 一聊白聊</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><h1><span>Sabrina Carpenter - Manchild</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>Christina Perri - A Thousand Years</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>LÒNIS - Good to Go (feat. Daphne Willis)</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>ORANGE RANGE - イケナイ太陽</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>王心凌 - 昨天、今天</span></h1>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66926530c9a9a0a1deb174bf/lmIBiZnCInmZXIoGY1RjgINTAFkY.m4a" length="68588091" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:22:26</itunes:duration>
