  <item>
    <title>Vol.39 命悬一线，考验默契度的时候到了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/684ec5dc4abe6e29cb3dbb0a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">684ec5dc4abe6e29cb3dbb0a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Jun 2025 06:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好久不见呀～上周莫名鸽了一期是因为七仔去过生日啦～（生日当然要愉快的玩耍啦～祝我生日快乐）</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们打算玩一款我期待了很久的游戏，叫做命悬一线</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 大家好～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 介绍一下游戏规则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 最赚钱的直播赛道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a> 和家人相处时，用什么方式能增进感情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">07:05</a> 令人感动的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 在恋爱中做什么事会让对方感到幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="879">14:39</a> 一个物体的透气性能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 被单相思对象说什么会开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> 小时候想要的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 被人送了什么土特产会开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a> 喜欢的人有什么癖好会让你吃惊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1253">20:53</a> 平常经常听到的话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">22:07</a> 忽然有了一天的假期，最棒的过法是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 站在高中生的角度想想，上课发生什么会觉得很惨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 想让人拍照的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> 最容易得罪别人的话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 只有男性或者女性会喜欢的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1835">30:35</a> 无论如何都无法原谅的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1896">31:36</a> 成熟的言行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">33:55</a> 冰箱里有什么会让人感到情绪高涨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2205">36:45</a> 极具破坏力的话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 站在爷爷奶奶的角度想想，孙子说了什么话会开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> 你做什么行为给人的第一印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2485">41:25</a> 学什么乐器最容易上手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2625">43:45</a> 说什么谎言最容易被识破</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2855">47:35</a> 大家下次再见～</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：没完没聊 一聊白聊</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hudson Thames - Last Call.mp3</span></p><span></span><p><span>大川Dietry - 不敢死也不想活.mp3</span></p><span></span><p><span>つじあやの - 風になる.mp3</span></p>]]></description>
